  "description": "REH 4.2. Slot 20 GetOccupantFundingPercentages(occ, &a, &b) with the caller's a = 0.3, b = 0.4: no staff item -> 1.0 / 1.0; a staff item whose department is unknown -> both unchanged; the department's funding (0.8) when not locally funded, the item's own percentage (0.5) when it is; b = 1.0 without a vehicle item, the vehicle department's funding (0.75) with one, unchanged with an unknown vehicle department. Efficiency: (1, 1) without a staff item; otherwise e1 = effCurve(a x 100) x 0.01 and e2 = coverageCurve(b x 100) x 0.01, with (a, b) starting at (0, 0) [question 1]: an unknown department gives (0, 0.5). A striking building has e1 = a x strike efficiency (0.5 x 0x3E4CCCCC = 0x3DCCCCCC) unless ignored. Slot 19 SetOccupantFundingPercentages sets the staff then the vehicle percentage (SetLocalFundingPercent) and sets dirty; a missing item sets dirty and stops; an unknown department stops without dirty.",
